1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,555
Ren: If it is dark, do not use your eyes.

2
00:00:04,225 --> 00:00:07,409
VALE & SON DISPATCH: The Quiet Hand. Part
four of ten: the tunnel.

3
00:00:07,729 --> 00:00:11,580
Ren: Noor waits on the far side. One point
one kilometres.

4
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:15,730
Ren: Into the black. Hand on the wall.

5
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,757
Ren: Never shine a torch straight ahead.

6
00:00:19,427 --> 00:00:22,603
Ren: Three shapes. Between the rails.

7
00:00:23,273 --> 00:00:24,007
Ren: One.

8
00:00:25,273 --> 00:00:25,836
Ren: Two.

9
00:00:27,273 --> 00:00:27,841
Ren: Three.

10
00:00:29,273 --> 00:00:32,402
Ren: They did not even flinch. Asleep.

11
00:00:33,072 --> 00:00:38,425
Ren: Torch low. Beam on the rail. Eyes
shut.

12
00:00:39,095 --> 00:00:42,114
Ren: Hour twelve. One hundred seventy-one
to go.

13
00:00:42,784 --> 00:00:46,403
Ren: Light at the far end. One point one
kilometres done.

14
00:00:47,073 --> 00:00:50,220
Ren: Zombies do not sleep. Someone woke
them.

15
00:00:50,890 --> 00:00:57,653
VALE & SON DISPATCH: Part four of ten, The
Quiet Hand. Next: 92 percent. Follow for part five.

